  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/xejIPMygG_2Ti8RXwa0yhnyGXQuv8E8nZB9eTCVCpLiemN1oe9XNItVfZzu5jb6j1l7ZuUrf-o_VmjLjSl-PREtrHbeT8Lyhfux0y-AxlsathMsKa2xm7SeaUfL30zcQer-2pGo_y4fxK5W724cifQ] \n\nGiven: 16 * 2 * 4 * 8 * 10 * 34\n\nFirst we will check options one by one as below:\n\n1) –, +, ×, ÷, =\n\n⇒ 16 - 2 + 4 × __**8 ÷ 10**__ = 34 \n\n⇒ 16 - 2 + __**4 × 0.8**__ = 34\n\n⇒ __**16**__ - 2 __**+ 3.2**____** **__= 34\n\n⇒ __**19.2 - 2**__ = 17.2\n\n⇒ 17.2 ≠ 34, this is not possible\n\n2) ÷, ×, +, –, =\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 2**__ × 4 + 8 - 10 = 34\n\n⇒ __**8 ×**____** 4**__ + 8 - 10 = 34\n\n⇒ __**32 + 8**__ - 10 = 34\n\n⇒ __**40 - 10**__ = 34\n\n⇒ 30 ≠ 34, this is not possible\n\n3) ÷, ×, –, +, =\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 2**__ × 4 - 8 + 10 = 34\n\n⇒ __**8 ×**____** 4**__ - 8 + 10 = 34\n\n⇒ __**32**__ - 8 __**+ 10**__ = 34\n\n⇒ __**42 - 8**__ = 34\n\n⇒ **34 = 34**, this is possible\n\n4) ×, ÷, –, +, =\n\n⇒ 16 × __**2 ÷ 4**__ - 8 + 10 = 34\n\n⇒ __**16 **____**× 0.5**__ - 8 + 10 = 34\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 8 __**+ 10**__ = 34\n\n⇒ __**18 - 8**__ = 34\n\n⇒ 10 ≠ 34, this is not possible\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
